   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Layout from a Sentence\n\n1. Write the idea in the Prompt Enhancer on the left (layout mode), saying where each thing goes:\n   left / right, upper / lower, in the centre, at the far end. Any language the text encoder reads.\n   Give the exact words of any text (a title, a signature), or it may invent them.\n2. Press DRAFT LAYOUT under the Layout Editor's canvas: only the enhancer and the editor run (no sampling)\n   and the boxes it wrote appear on the canvas, one per thing, with its name and caption.\n3. Move, resize, draw or delete boxes; select one to edit its caption or text.\n4. Press GENERATE (the same as Run): the image is made with your boxes. The enhancer runs again only if\n   its inputs changed; your boxes are never replaced by a normal run (it only offers the new draft with IMPORT).\n5. MOSS Text Check reads each text box back from the image and says exact / close / missing.\n\nTried on 8 ideas, one seed each (tools/RESULTS.md, Layout mode): the enhancer put all 28 stated elements\nin the stated region; MOSS drew 26 inside their boxes. Check the boxes before you press GENERATE."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
